    <name>Blick auf die Seezunge (Rothsee) – Rothsee Runde von Allersberg</name>
    <desc>Distance: 5.239km, Estimated duration: 1.33h, Elevation up: 14.662224071846026m, Elevation down: 14.63598188571899m, Grade: easy</desc>
